        "heading": "Fields",
        "depth": 2,
        "markdown": "## Fields\n\nEach field has:\n\n- a title\n- a type — **text** or **markdown**\n- a required flag\n\nFields can be reordered.\nAdding a field also adds its layout item with the **display** operation.\nRemoving a field also removes its layout item.\n\n"
